WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.166 --> 00:00:05.400
With Ash's fifth Gym Battle win next on their agenda,

2
00:00:05.466 --> 00:00:07.200
our heroes continue to make their way

3
00:00:07.266 --> 00:00:09.466
through the wilderness of the Lumiose Badlands.

4
00:00:09.533 --> 00:00:13.433
Once we get through this area, we'll be close to Lumiose City.

5
00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.000
- Sorry I kept you all waiting.
- No prob!

6
00:00:20.066 --> 00:00:22.166
- Are you OK, Clemont?
- Pikachu.

7
00:00:23.733 --> 00:00:27.766
Hey, Ash, are you sorry you weren't able to challenge the Lumiose Gym?

8
00:00:27.833 --> 00:00:31.700
Yeah, but back then, you decided that challengers should be strong enough

9
00:00:31.766 --> 00:00:34.066
to have earned four Gym Badges first, right?

10
00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:35.700
Huh? Well, yeah...

11
00:00:35.766 --> 00:00:39.500
Since that's what you wanted, I'll just come back when I've gotten four.

12
00:00:39.566 --> 00:00:42.900
- Pikachu.
- If that's what you want.

13
00:00:42.966 --> 00:00:44.200
- One thing...
- Huh?

14
00:00:44.266 --> 00:00:47.700
I want the battle to be against you instead of Clembot.

15
00:00:47.766 --> 00:00:52.166
Huh? Deal! I'll make sure I get stronger so I can give you a Gym Battle

16
00:00:52.233 --> 00:00:55.200
you'll never forget for the rest of your life!

17
00:00:55.266 --> 00:00:59.500
- That sounds good to me!
- Great! That's what we'll do!

18
00:00:59.566 --> 00:01:02.833
When we get to Lumiose City, let's have our battle right away!

19
00:01:02.900 --> 00:01:05.933
Sure! You've got it!

20
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

21
00:01:07.866 --> 00:01:09.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

22
00:01:09.633 --> 00:01:13.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

23
00:01:13.066 --> 00:01:14.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

24
00:01:14.533 --> 00:01:18.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

25
00:01:18.366 --> 00:01:21.566
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

26
00:01:21.633 --> 00:01:25.000
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

27
00:01:25.066 --> 00:01:28.966
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

28
00:01:29.033 --> 00:01:33.666
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

29
00:01:33.733 --> 00:01:35.933
♪ Pokémon! ♪

30
00:01:38.700 --> 00:01:42.266
The Future is Now, Thanks to Determination!

31
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.300
I'm really hungry!

32
00:01:49.366 --> 00:01:53.300
- It's almost ready, Bonnie.
- Hm. All clean.

33
00:01:53.366 --> 00:01:56.566
- Make sure you eat a lot, buddy!
- Pika, pika!

34
00:01:56.633 --> 00:02:00.133
You know what they say. You can't battle on an empty stomach.

35
00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:04.133
Of course Ash remembers the deal we made.

36
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:07.233
- Froakie, you've gotta hang in there!
- Froakie...

37
00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:11.000
Ever since I ran into Ash, I've learned so much from him.

38
00:02:11.066 --> 00:02:12.133
So what do you say?

39
00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:15.833
Is it enough if I simply have a battle as a Gym Leader?

40
00:02:15.900 --> 00:02:17.200
Are you OK?

41
00:02:17.266 --> 00:02:20.500
Am I good enough to have a meaningful battle?

42
00:02:20.566 --> 00:02:21.900
Pika, pi!

43
00:02:23.433 --> 00:02:25.833
Uh! Ah! Waah!

44
00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:28.900
Uh! Aah!

45
00:02:28.966 --> 00:02:31.400
Chu, pika! Pika!

46
00:02:31.466 --> 00:02:34.066
If one hit isn't enough, we'll just hit a bunch of times!

47
00:02:34.133 --> 00:02:36.066
Pika!

48
00:02:40.766 --> 00:02:43.766
- Pika, pi...

49
00:02:43.833 --> 00:02:44.766
Pi, pi!

50
00:02:46.233 --> 00:02:49.200
You can't stop me!

51
00:02:58.066 --> 00:03:00.800
- Electro Ball!
- Pika, pika, pika!

52
00:03:00.866 --> 00:03:04.300
Aura Sphere, go!

53
00:03:04.366 --> 00:03:06.466
Chu, pi!

54
00:03:06.533 --> 00:03:08.500
Finish this with Thunderbolt!

55
00:03:08.566 --> 00:03:13.600
Pikachu!

56
00:03:16.100 --> 00:03:17.433
Pi!

57
00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:24.633
If only I could give something back to Ash, as a Gym Leader.

58
00:03:26.933 --> 00:03:29.766
- Clemont, it's burning!

59
00:03:35.166 --> 00:03:37.566
- Hard as a Rock type.
- Denne-ne.

60
00:03:37.633 --> 00:03:41.500
- Sorry about that, Bonnie.
- That isn't like you at all.

61
00:03:41.566 --> 00:03:45.066
- Are you all right?
- I got lost in my thoughts.

62
00:03:49.333 --> 00:03:51.366
- Ah...
- Pika.

63
00:03:56.533 --> 00:03:59.900
- What's that?
- That's the Kalos Power Plant.

64
00:03:59.966 --> 00:04:03.300
- A power plant?
- My big brother designed that place!

65
00:04:03.366 --> 00:04:05.100
- Huh?
- Not exactly.

66
00:04:05.166 --> 00:04:09.066
- I just helped with the programming.
- I think that's so awesome!

67
00:04:09.133 --> 00:04:13.733
The Kalos Power Plant collects the sun's energy directly from space,

68
00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:17.366
then transmits it down to our planet's surface as microwaves.

69
00:04:17.433 --> 00:04:20.600
It's stored in a superconductor energy storage ring,

70
00:04:20.666 --> 00:04:22.600
then distributed to Lumiose City.

71
00:04:22.666 --> 00:04:24.433
Yup. That makes sense.

72
00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:26.466
Wow, Ash. You got that?

73
00:04:26.533 --> 00:04:29.900
Yeah. Science is so amazing, which is why it makes sense!

74
00:04:29.966 --> 00:04:31.666
Right?

75
00:04:31.733 --> 00:04:35.433
I know. Why don't we go check out the power plant up close?

76
00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.866
Good idea! And maybe we'll come across some rare Electric types!

77
00:04:38.933 --> 00:04:40.866
- It's possible.
- Let's go!

78
00:04:48.133 --> 00:04:50.466
It looks like a secret base.

79
00:04:50.533 --> 00:04:52.866
That's strange. Huh!

80
00:04:52.933 --> 00:04:55.766
That antenna is usually pointed toward the sky.

81
00:04:55.833 --> 00:04:59.066
- So do antennas feel sad, too?
- Denne.

82
00:04:59.133 --> 00:05:01.866
- Maybe something happened.
- Yeah, could be.

83
00:05:01.933 --> 00:05:04.366
- We should go check it out.
- Right!

84
00:05:04.433 --> 00:05:05.833
Pika!

85
00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:11.066
-Pi... Pika, pika...

86
00:05:11.133 --> 00:05:12.666
Huh? Something wrong?

87
00:05:12.733 --> 00:05:14.433
-Ne... ne, ne...

88
00:05:14.500 --> 00:05:16.433
- Dedenne's acting strange, too!
- Lux.

89
00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:17.666
Something's not right!

90
00:05:17.733 --> 00:05:21.100
- Lux, lux!
- Luxio?

91
00:05:21.166 --> 00:05:22.666
-Lux! Lux!

92
00:05:22.733 --> 00:05:25.800
- Pika, pika!
- Lux! Oh, Lux!

93
00:05:27.233 --> 00:05:30.633
- Dedenne?
- Luxio?

94
00:05:30.700 --> 00:05:32.300
Pikachu, where are you going?

95
00:05:38.066 --> 00:05:40.500
-Luxio!

96
00:05:40.566 --> 00:05:43.300
- Dedenne!
- What's gotten into those three?

97
00:05:43.366 --> 00:05:45.566
- Let's follow them!
- Right!

98
00:05:56.400 --> 00:05:58.866
- What?
- Look at all of them!

99
00:05:58.933 --> 00:06:01.900
- They're all Electric types, too.
- Dedenne...

100
00:06:01.966 --> 00:06:06.566
Electric-type Pokémon... And they're all gathering at the power plant.

101
00:06:06.633 --> 00:06:07.900
-Huh?

102
00:06:18.133 --> 00:06:20.100
- Pikachu!
- Dedenne!

103
00:06:20.166 --> 00:06:21.066
Hey, wait!

104
00:06:24.133 --> 00:06:26.600
- Aah!
- What do we do?

105
00:06:26.666 --> 00:06:30.333
Maybe the power plant has something to do with their strange behaviour.

106
00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:32.133
It all happened so quickly!

107
00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:34.566
We've got to help Pikachu and the others.

108
00:06:34.633 --> 00:06:36.666
Got any ideas on how we can do it?

109
00:06:36.733 --> 00:06:40.466
I think so. There are blueprints of this plant.

110
00:06:40.533 --> 00:06:43.866
I've seen them before, though I only saw them once.

111
00:06:43.933 --> 00:06:46.933
Ah! The plant has giant air vents.

112
00:06:47.000 --> 00:06:48.933
- That's how we get in!
- Great!

113
00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:56.366
- This is it.
- 'Kay!

114
00:06:56.433 --> 00:06:59.900
- Come on out, Frogadier!
- Frogadier!

115
00:06:59.966 --> 00:07:03.400
See those vents? I need you to stop their fans.

116
00:07:03.466 --> 00:07:06.600
Fro! Frogadier!

117
00:07:09.033 --> 00:07:12.233
- Careful. Watch your head.
- Huh?

118
00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.433
Huh? Oh...

119
00:07:22.133 --> 00:07:25.800
These vents... connect... the whole plant.

120
00:07:30.266 --> 00:07:34.266
Somebody's down there. Oh no! They've been tied up!

121
00:07:34.333 --> 00:07:35.733
- Huh?
- Is somebody up there?

122
00:07:38.866 --> 00:07:41.333
-Who are you three?

123
00:07:41.400 --> 00:07:44.366
- Are you one of them, too?
- One of who?

124
00:07:46.400 --> 00:07:50.500
- This plant is under siege.
- Wait. Somebody took control of it?

125
00:07:50.566 --> 00:07:52.333
Yeah. You got that right.

126
00:07:52.400 --> 00:07:56.866
A trio of hijackers consisting of a man, a woman, and a Meowth.

127
00:07:56.933 --> 00:08:00.066
- Not only that, the Meowth can talk!
- Huh?

128
00:08:00.133 --> 00:08:01.666
A talking Meowth, huh?

129
00:08:03.233 --> 00:08:06.166
Yeah, we let them in thinking they were in need.

130
00:08:06.233 --> 00:08:08.633
Help us out, please!

131
00:08:08.700 --> 00:08:11.566
We're lost, alone, and we're scared.

132
00:08:11.633 --> 00:08:14.433
If we don't get some water, we'll shrivel up!

133
00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:16.166
Oh!

134
00:08:16.233 --> 00:08:19.366
-Feel better now?

135
00:08:19.433 --> 00:08:21.433
You lugs are lifesavers!

136
00:08:21.500 --> 00:08:23.866
You've allowed us to get back to work.

137
00:08:23.933 --> 00:08:26.866
All right, shall we begin?

138
00:08:31.766 --> 00:08:33.866
-What do you think you're doin'?

139
00:08:33.933 --> 00:08:36.266
Well, we'll alter your programming

140
00:08:36.333 --> 00:08:39.866
and convert microwaves into Pokémon control waves, dig?

141
00:08:39.933 --> 00:08:42.666
Simply pointing your antenna towards the ground

142
00:08:42.733 --> 00:08:44.866
and broadcasting those Pokémon control waves,

143
00:08:44.933 --> 00:08:49.100
we'll be able to catch a substantial number of Electric-type Pokémon at once!

144
00:08:49.166 --> 00:08:50.866
- Clear and to the point.
- Grr.

145
00:08:50.933 --> 00:08:54.700
You can't! You have no idea what that will do to the Pokémon, so stop it!

146
00:08:54.766 --> 00:08:56.833
Quiet, please.

147
00:08:56.900 --> 00:08:59.533
Now, Inkay, be a dear and shut their loud mouths.

148
00:09:03.800 --> 00:09:07.233
And then, when we woke up, we found ourselves locked up in here.

149
00:09:07.300 --> 00:09:10.033
This has gotta be Team Rocket.

150
00:09:10.100 --> 00:09:12.966
That's why Pikachu and the others are acting so strangely!

151
00:09:13.033 --> 00:09:14.966
It's because of the Pokémon control waves!

152
00:09:15.033 --> 00:09:17.500
So do you know where they are now?

153
00:09:17.566 --> 00:09:19.833
They must be in the power plant's control room.

154
00:09:19.900 --> 00:09:23.200
You see, the control room is right next to the superconductor ring.

155
00:09:23.266 --> 00:09:24.866
And I'm pretty sure they're still there.

156
00:09:24.933 --> 00:09:26.900
So can you tell us how to get to them?

157
00:09:26.966 --> 00:09:28.800
The route isn't complicated,

158
00:09:28.866 --> 00:09:31.666
but they've locked every door between here and there.

159
00:09:31.733 --> 00:09:35.600
But we might be able to open them from the sub-control room!

160
00:09:35.666 --> 00:09:38.300
You just leave unlocking those doors to us!

161
00:09:38.366 --> 00:09:40.166
That's great. Thank you.

162
00:09:40.233 --> 00:09:42.566
So the first door we go through is that one!

163
00:09:42.633 --> 00:09:44.800
We'll force it open!

164
00:09:44.866 --> 00:09:47.833
All right, Bunnelby, let's go!

165
00:09:47.900 --> 00:09:49.066
You too, Pancham!

166
00:09:50.066 --> 00:09:53.666
- Hawlucha, use Karate Chop!
- And Bunnelby, Double Slap!

167
00:09:53.733 --> 00:09:55.600
Pancham, use Arm Thrust!

168
00:09:56.933 --> 00:09:58.766
We did it!

169
00:09:59.933 --> 00:10:01.933
Time to rescue those Pokémon!

170
00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:04.033
Who's that Pokémon?

171
00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.300
It's Luxray!

172
00:10:11.366 --> 00:10:14.933
Luxray!

173
00:10:19.500 --> 00:10:22.966
This is keen. What a scene!

174
00:10:23.033 --> 00:10:25.966
It's like a whole universe of Electric types.

175
00:10:26.033 --> 00:10:27.133
Huh?

176
00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:32.866
There's a Pikachu! You don't think that's the twerp's, do you?

177
00:10:32.933 --> 00:10:35.433
Well, if in fact it is, that means one thing!

178
00:10:35.500 --> 00:10:38.033
Those twerps are a hop, skip and a jump from here!

179
00:10:40.000 --> 00:10:43.333
Please stand by. We're unlocking the door.

180
00:10:43.400 --> 00:10:47.033
We don't know what's happening inside, so please be careful.

181
00:10:47.100 --> 00:10:48.566
We will!

182
00:10:48.633 --> 00:10:50.133
Good luck to you.

183
00:10:58.366 --> 00:10:59.566
Huh... Huh?

184
00:10:59.633 --> 00:11:02.866
Pikachu! Hey, Pikachu!

185
00:11:02.933 --> 00:11:06.933
No use. They're not reacting to your voice at all.

186
00:11:07.000 --> 00:11:08.200
Twerp time!

187
00:11:08.266 --> 00:11:11.933
I demand you twerps butt out!

188
00:11:12.000 --> 00:11:13.833
You may think you're hiding,

189
00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:17.733
- but you're as obvious as your dumbness!
- Huh?

190
00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:20.900
It's game, set and match for the team in the driver's seat!

191
00:11:20.966 --> 00:11:24.400
We've got a mountain of Electric types and that's pretty neat!

192
00:11:24.466 --> 00:11:26.366
So get used to the taste of defeat!

193
00:11:26.433 --> 00:11:30.833
From this moment forward, the Kalos Power Plant is under our control.

194
00:11:30.900 --> 00:11:35.100
Of course, that means one thing. We're controlling Lumiose City as well!

195
00:11:35.166 --> 00:11:39.566
And if you try to get in our way, we'll totally turn the city into Panicville.

196
00:11:39.633 --> 00:11:40.966
Get a load of this!

197
00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:44.066
Huh?

198
00:11:44.133 --> 00:11:45.566
Not that!

199
00:11:52.566 --> 00:11:54.666
Huh?

200
00:11:56.566 --> 00:12:00.233
- The city's power!
- They shut it all off!

201
00:12:00.300 --> 00:12:03.933
- Now what are we going to do?
- What can we do?

202
00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:06.566
All right. We'll do as you say.

203
00:12:06.633 --> 00:12:09.366
Good choice. You're not so dumb.

204
00:12:09.433 --> 00:12:11.933
With all of Lumiose City being held hostage,

205
00:12:12.000 --> 00:12:14.300
all you can do is keep being twerps.

206
00:12:14.366 --> 00:12:16.600
Hey, Ash! What now?

207
00:12:17.600 --> 00:12:20.300
- Clemont. Ready yet?
- Almost.

208
00:12:20.366 --> 00:12:22.333
What? You want to reverse the current?

209
00:12:22.400 --> 00:12:26.066
That's right. Reversing the current will overload the entire system

210
00:12:26.133 --> 00:12:29.333
and stop the flow of Pokémon control waves for a short while.

211
00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:34.166
It's designed so we're able to reverse the current remotely, like with the locks.

212
00:12:34.233 --> 00:12:36.833
But still, it's going to take us a while to do it.

213
00:12:36.900 --> 00:12:41.133
Wait until the superconductor energy ring in the central area turns red.

214
00:12:41.200 --> 00:12:44.066
That's the sign it's ready to be reversed.

215
00:12:44.133 --> 00:12:46.866
- And, Clemont, when that happens...
- Right!

216
00:12:46.933 --> 00:12:49.800
I'll reverse the current, which will overload the system.

217
00:12:49.866 --> 00:12:52.600
Good. It's really the only way.

218
00:12:54.766 --> 00:12:57.166
Don't let your guard down.

219
00:12:57.233 --> 00:13:00.133
Let's be extra-certain they can't pull any fast ones.

220
00:13:00.200 --> 00:13:02.766
- How?
- What's goin' on in that head of yours?

221
00:13:02.833 --> 00:13:07.233
We simply force all of those Electric-type Pokémon to attack the twerps.

222
00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:10.733
Command waves. So let's give it the gas!

223
00:13:20.166 --> 00:13:23.800
Ah!

224
00:13:23.866 --> 00:13:27.600
- All right! I've got this!
- Follow me, quick!

225
00:13:27.666 --> 00:13:32.133
- Pikachu!

226
00:13:43.666 --> 00:13:46.133
It's too dangerous! Stop!

227
00:13:46.200 --> 00:13:49.000
I can't let Team Rocket use these Pokémon!

228
00:13:49.066 --> 00:13:51.966
No way. There's no way!

229
00:14:05.300 --> 00:14:08.100
Pikachu...

230
00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:13.266
- Pika...
- I'm gonna get you out of here.

231
00:14:13.333 --> 00:14:15.966
And I'm not gonna stop until I do!

232
00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:19.033
Oh!

233
00:14:19.100 --> 00:14:23.800
No! Don't let the twerp get close to Pikachu! That's asking for trouble!

234
00:14:23.866 --> 00:14:25.900
I'll make it double!

235
00:14:29.233 --> 00:14:31.200
Lux!

236
00:14:31.266 --> 00:14:32.333
Aah!

237
00:14:33.666 --> 00:14:36.000
- Stop it!
- Clemont!

238
00:14:40.033 --> 00:14:43.433
Clemont, no!

239
00:14:43.500 --> 00:14:47.833
Oh, Luxio! Luxio, it's me!

240
00:14:49.700 --> 00:14:51.466
Don't be a hero!

241
00:14:51.533 --> 00:14:54.466
- Quick! Turn it up to 11!
- Or even 12!

242
00:14:57.033 --> 00:14:59.300
- Lux?
- Huh? Luxio?

243
00:14:59.366 --> 00:15:04.266
Luxi, Luxio!

244
00:15:06.833 --> 00:15:08.866
Excellent! Keep it up!

245
00:15:08.933 --> 00:15:11.800
- Clemont, no!
- We'll get you out of there!

246
00:15:11.866 --> 00:15:13.866
Oh, Luxio!

247
00:15:13.933 --> 00:15:17.100
I'm sorry! It's painful, isn't it?

248
00:15:17.166 --> 00:15:19.866
It hurts, doesn't it?

249
00:15:24.433 --> 00:15:28.733
I'm here. And I won't quit until you're safe and sound!

250
00:15:29.833 --> 00:15:31.733
Luxio...

251
00:15:34.000 --> 00:15:36.766
- What's with the red?
- It's pretty, but strange!

252
00:15:36.833 --> 00:15:39.200
Look! The superconductor ring's colour!

253
00:15:39.266 --> 00:15:41.766
It turned red just like they said it would!

254
00:15:41.833 --> 00:15:45.666
Come on Luxio, we can get through this together!

255
00:15:45.733 --> 00:15:48.700
Clemontic Gear, on!

256
00:15:48.766 --> 00:15:51.966
Just hang on! I'll act as a ground!

257
00:15:52.033 --> 00:15:53.666
- Clemont!
- Clemont!

258
00:15:53.733 --> 00:15:57.866
All right, I want you to keep using Discharge!

259
00:15:57.933 --> 00:16:01.033
Luxio! Luxio!

260
00:16:05.333 --> 00:16:07.766
-What was that?

261
00:16:07.833 --> 00:16:10.600
Get busy and fix it, stat! As fast as I can!

262
00:16:11.600 --> 00:16:12.466
Pika?

263
00:16:12.533 --> 00:16:14.166
Denne?

264
00:16:14.233 --> 00:16:16.966
- Dedenne!
- Denne-ne!

265
00:16:17.033 --> 00:16:19.966
- Hey, buddy!
- Pika, pi!

266
00:16:20.033 --> 00:16:22.800
-Lux.

267
00:16:22.866 --> 00:16:24.333
- Clemont!
- Oh no!

268
00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:29.566
Luxio, I can't thank you enough for everything you've done.

269
00:16:29.633 --> 00:16:31.833
Lux, lux, lux.

270
00:16:31.900 --> 00:16:34.366
Huh?

271
00:16:35.366 --> 00:16:37.500
-We have ignition.

272
00:16:37.566 --> 00:16:40.666
- So! Back to those command waves!
- With pleasure!

273
00:16:47.833 --> 00:16:49.033
- Is that what I think it is?
- Pika.

274
00:16:53.766 --> 00:16:56.433
Luxray!

275
00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:58.933
- It evolved!
- Denne!

276
00:16:59.000 --> 00:17:01.000
Ugh! Uh!

277
00:17:01.066 --> 00:17:03.500
Ray!

278
00:17:07.066 --> 00:17:10.766
Look at that! Luxio evolved and learned how to use Electric Terrain!

279
00:17:15.166 --> 00:17:18.266
- Is that allowed?
- Oy. I don't feel good!

280
00:17:18.333 --> 00:17:19.533
Ah!

281
00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:26.133
Luxray. The Gleam Eyes Pokémon, and the evolved form of Luxio.

282
00:17:26.200 --> 00:17:29.766
Using the power to see through walls, Luxray can track down hidden opponents,

283
00:17:29.833 --> 00:17:32.766
and even locate lost children.

284
00:17:32.833 --> 00:17:36.766
Good. Now, time to make our counterattack!

285
00:17:36.833 --> 00:17:40.766
When Electric Terrain's in effect, Electric-type attacks get a power boost!

286
00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:44.766
- Everybody! Let's go!
- Pikachu!

287
00:17:50.200 --> 00:17:52.433
You don't wanna do that!

288
00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.600
And even if you do, don't!

289
00:17:57.433 --> 00:18:00.466
No!

290
00:18:02.133 --> 00:18:06.100
We're blasting off again!

291
00:18:14.766 --> 00:18:19.200
I'm truly sorry that some sections of the power plant were destroyed.

292
00:18:19.266 --> 00:18:21.266
Don't be. Not a problem!

293
00:18:21.333 --> 00:18:25.700
Because of you, Lumiose City is safe. We're the ones who should apologise.

294
00:18:25.766 --> 00:18:29.966
We're using the subsystem to supply power to the city, so everything is fine.

295
00:18:30.033 --> 00:18:31.966
That's great!

296
00:18:32.033 --> 00:18:34.600
And I learned something else from you, Ash.

297
00:18:34.666 --> 00:18:36.300
I didn't do anything.

298
00:18:36.366 --> 00:18:40.033
We were able to get all of the Pokémon out of there thanks to you.

299
00:18:40.100 --> 00:18:43.800
- He's right. You were really amazing!
- Yeah. You were so great!

300
00:18:43.866 --> 00:18:48.833
Well, thank you all. It's nice to know you feel that way.

301
00:18:54.066 --> 00:18:57.133
I'm on my way to our main offices in Lumiose City,

302
00:18:57.200 --> 00:19:00.366
- to brief them on what happened today.
- Oh!

303
00:19:01.366 --> 00:19:02.966
Hm!

304
00:19:06.533 --> 00:19:10.233
Would it be possible if I came along with you to Lumiose City?

305
00:19:10.300 --> 00:19:11.433
Huh?

306
00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:13.333
Sure. If you want.

307
00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:15.900
Clemont, what are you doing?

308
00:19:17.066 --> 00:19:20.200
I think it's time I headed back to Lumiose City.

309
00:19:20.266 --> 00:19:21.566
Then we'll go along.

310
00:19:21.633 --> 00:19:23.566
- No.
- Huh?

311
00:19:23.633 --> 00:19:27.866
I'm just not satisfied with where I am right now.

312
00:19:27.933 --> 00:19:31.100
I wanna go home and work hard and train.

313
00:19:31.166 --> 00:19:34.100
Before you come to the Lumiose City Gym.

314
00:19:34.166 --> 00:19:36.233
By the time you challenge the Lumiose Gym,

315
00:19:36.300 --> 00:19:40.033
I'll be ready to give you a battle that you'd expect from a Gym Leader.

316
00:19:40.100 --> 00:19:45.066
I see. But still, I'm not gonna lose, no matter what!

317
00:19:45.133 --> 00:19:47.000
Hm!

318
00:19:48.433 --> 00:19:50.233
Serena?

319
00:19:50.300 --> 00:19:53.333
- Will you look after Bonnie?
- You can count on me.

320
00:19:53.400 --> 00:19:56.000
I'm not a little kid! I'll be fine!

321
00:19:56.066 --> 00:19:58.066
Hm.

322
00:20:06.366 --> 00:20:09.700
I'll be waiting at the Lumiose Gym!

323
00:20:09.766 --> 00:20:11.366
See you soon!

324
00:20:11.433 --> 00:20:15.200
Don't forget, I'm gonna beat you and win my fifth badge for sure!

325
00:20:15.266 --> 00:20:17.666
We'll see. Since I'm not gonna lose either!

326
00:20:17.733 --> 00:20:20.666
Take care! Can't wait for our Gym Battle!

327
00:20:20.733 --> 00:20:21.933
Pika, pika!

328
00:20:22.833 --> 00:20:25.533
Because of our heroes' bold actions,

329
00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:28.666
the Kalos Power Plant is safely back in the right hands.

330
00:20:28.733 --> 00:20:31.933
Now, Clemont is off to Lumiose City by himself,

331
00:20:32.000 --> 00:20:33.400
for some time to reflect,

332
00:20:33.466 --> 00:20:37.000
while Ash eagerly looks forward to his upcoming battle against Clemont

333
00:20:37.066 --> 00:20:41.033
at the Lumiose Gym, as the journey continues!
